* What is Vibe Coding?

    "There's a new kind of coding I call 'vibe coding', where you entirely give up the wheel to the AI and just speak your intent, copy-paste error messages, and guide the model."
    — Andrej Karpathy

.image images/karpathy_tweet.png

.link https://x.com/karpathy/status/1886192184808149383

* What is Vibe Coding?

Zero Domain Knowledge Required
\_ You can enter a domain (e.g., WebGL, Rust, Game Physics) with zero prior syntax knowledge. 
\_ The LLM acts as the implementation layer while you focus on vision and UX.

Exploration & Rapid Iteration
\_ Rather than reading documentation for hours, you test ideas immediately by interacting with the model and reviewing live runtime feedback.
\_ Request different actions from the model i.e fix this issue, make this more transparent, or make the image resize

Automate Processes
\_ File Operations
\_ Send email, sms, social media post
\_ Make shopping for me

* How It Works? | Prompt

.image images/prompt_flow.png _ 960


* What is Prompt?

A descriptive natural language statement 

Passed to the LLM model

Formulated to guide and interact with generative AI models


* Anatomy of an Effective Prompt

 Persona / Role: Defines the identity, expertise, or perspective the AI should adopt 
 (e.g., “Act as an experienced financial analyst”)
 
 Task / Goal: States the primary action or objective clearly and explicitly 
 (e.g., “Summarize the core arguments” or “Generate an email template”)
 
 Context: Supplies background information, target audience details, 
 or reference data to ground the response
 
 Input Data: Provides the specific text, dataset, or material the model needs to analyze or transform
 
 Constraints & Warnings: Sets hard boundaries, negative rules, length limits, 
 or things the model must avoid 
 (e.g., “Keep under 200 words; do not invent statistics”)
 
 Output Format: Specifies the structural layout of the result, 
 such as bullet points, a markdown table, JSON, or step-by-step instructions
 
 Examples (Few-Shot): Provides a pattern or sample input-output pair 
 so the model mimics the exact style or format you want


* Anatomy of an Effective Prompt

Example Prompt:

    Assume you're an experienced software engineer who is good at Python programming. 

    I would like to develop a Python web app, the 2048 game. The tech stack for this project is 
    Python programming language and Python libraries. 

    Provide source code, running instructions, and Makefile that has all the steps to build 
    the development environment, running the project and even cleaning the mess afterwards.



* Anatomy of an Effective Prompt

Example Prompt:

    Act as a travel logistics expert. Construct a detailed travel plan 
    to travel from Houston, TX to San Francisco, CA within a strict budget of $500.

    Provide a breakdown of transportation options (air, rail, driving), 

    approximate costs, trade-offs (time vs. cost), 

    and top actionable tips for remaining within budget."

