* LLM Models

What are LLMs Models?

Machine learning models trained on vast piles of multimodal data (text, code, logs, binaries, images). 

They construct a high-dimensional indexed environment capable of mapping context to complex code solutions.

* LLM Models | Computing

Steps of Building LLM Models
- Pre-training & Training (Foundation Models)
- Post-training & Alignment (Usually adjusted with Reinforcement Learning)
- Fine-tuning (Better models for private data)
- Real-time Inference (Google Gemini, ChatGPT, or local llms)


