* Sample Project: Python 2048 Web App | Prompt

__My Vibe Coding Prompt__

Assume you're a veteran Python programmer and a client asked you to develop a project for a high school chess club. 
The project is an interactive game called 2048. If you would like to learn more about the game search web.
The tech stack for the project is Python programming language, Make, and Python libraries including but not limited to Flask, FastAPI, jija and so on.
The app is a web app that user can play multiple games with a username. Therefore, you need to keep track of each users game play.
Make the app as simple a possible and once we give this project to teachers, with only make run command, they should be able to run on a browser. 
Propose me the game plan and be professional on your decision process and consistent with the steps of the project development.


